  "note": "User chose one final production deployment approval on 2026-10-09. main/develop require PRs, resolved conversations and the four named checks with strict updates; configured human PR reviews are zero, native GitHub/Copilot constraints still apply. consciontologic approves production; agents never submit that approval or use bypass. Automation becomes active only after workflows reach main and restricted environments/credentials are configured. This file describes policy; it does not apply GitHub settings."
